{"id":"42bd57d799b5867e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"初等子结构","display":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["28-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构","depends_on":["[[28-df-structure]]","[[28-df-assignment]]","[[28-df-satisfaction]]","[[28-df-formula]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-elementary-substructure-—-初等子结构-$\\preceq$\">df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak A})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak A})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak A})_R),\\mathfrak B=(B,(c^{\\mathfrak B})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak B})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak B})_R)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak A})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak A})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak A})_R),\\mathfrak B=(B,(c^{\\mathfrak B})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak B})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak B})_R)\\)</span> 是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的结构，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:B\\to A\">\\(\\iota:B\\to A\\)</span> 为下式量化的候选映射；赋值和满足来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd01c8f753367315\" href=\"?note=fd01c8f753367315\" title=\"28-df-assignment\">28-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d82c10f45e77e524\" href=\"?note=d82c10f45e77e524\" title=\"28-df-satisfaction\">28-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;c^{\\mathfrak B}=c^{\\mathfrak A}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\;f^{\\mathfrak B}=f^{\\mathfrak A}\\restriction B^n\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge0\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\;R^{\\mathfrak B}=R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B^n.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;B\\subseteq A\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)\\;c^{\\mathfrak B}=c^{\\mathfrak A}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\;f^{\\mathfrak B}=f^{\\mathfrak A}\\restriction B^n\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\ge0\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\;R^{\\mathfrak B}=R^{\\mathfrak A}\\cap B^n.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\preceq\\mathfrak A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\iota:B\\to A\\;[\\forall b\\in B\\;\\iota(b)=b\\;\\land\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak B)\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\iota\\circ\\beta])].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B\\preceq\\mathfrak A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\iota:B\\to A\\;[\\forall b\\in B\\;\\iota(b)=b\\;\\land\\mathfrak B\\subseteq_S\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak B)\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\iota\\circ\\beta])].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子结构按同一签名的限制运算与关系定义；函数解释本身的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，因此闭包条件已包含在函数相等式中。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>R7复核：包含映射改为显式量化的B→A函数并要求逐元素恒等。因而该关系对全部同签名结构对都有确定真值；B不包含于A时没有满足恒等条件的候选映射，避免依靠未定义的部分记号ι。结构与载体分别保留为𝔄、A及𝔅、B，公开关系签名不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-elementary-substructure-—-初等子结构-$\\preceq$","text":"df-elementary-substructure — 初等子结构 $\\preceq$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fd01c8f753367315","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-satisfaction","